    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We've had this conversation before, haven't we?&quot; says the shadow on the doorway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a spiral, Laura must carve her way through the depths of her unconscious mind or sink into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Survival Horror\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find supplies and survive as you navigate a deserted town with monsters that will haunt you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will change with every loop, becoming more corrupted as you unearth previous buried trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with various weapons, Laura is not utterly hopeless against her pursuers. Fight through the nightmare and earn your life back, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles and uncover the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths hide in plain sight; others require key pieces of your memories to unlock. Solve these puzzles to unlock new areas and peel back the curtain of painful memories you forgot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We've had this conversation before, haven't we?&quot; says the shadow on the doorway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped within a spiral, Laura must carve her way through the depths of her unconscious mind or sink into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Survival Horror\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find supplies and survive as you navigate a deserted town with monsters that will haunt you around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment will change with every loop, becoming more corrupted as you unearth previous buried trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with various weapons, Laura is not utterly hopeless against her pursuers. Fight through the nightmare and earn your life back, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles and uncover the truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths hide in plain sight; others require key pieces of your memories to unlock. Solve these puzzles to unlock new areas and peel back the curtain of painful memories you forgot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
